    "description": "Master the art of high-stakes parkour in Vex 3, an intense platformer that tests your grit and precision. Guide your stickhero through a gauntlet of lethal traps, spinning sawblades, and treacherous spikes as you race to the exit flag. Master complex maneuvers like wall-jumping, sliding, and ledge-climbing to navigate through increasingly intricate and dangerous layouts. With its tight controls and 'just one more try' gameplay loop, it offers a pure test of reflexes and spatial reasoning for platforming fans.\n\nHow to Play & Tips:\n- Slide to boost: You can slide down certain slopes to gain extra jump distance—time your jump at the very end of the slope for a massive 'super jump'.\n- Use checkpoints: Don't ignore the flags! Always touch the light-blue flags to save your progress; some harder acts have very long sequences between checkpoints.\n- Watch the sawblades: Sawblades always move in a fixed pattern; wait for one full cycle to learn the timing before making your dash.",
