    "href": "/g/vex-4",
    "description": "Push your precision to the limit in Vex 4, the challenging sequel that introduces even more devious obstacles and complex level designs. Navigate your agile stickhero through a gauntlet of moving sawblades, crumbling bridges, and gravity-defying jumps. Master the flow of each 'act' by learning the patterns of every trap and perfecting your timing. With its smooth animations and incredibly responsive controls, Vex 4 provides a rewarding and intense platforming experience that demands patience and total focus.\n\nHow to Play & Tips:\n- Master the 'Wall Climb': You can climb vertical shafts by jumping back and forth between two walls—keep a steady rhythm to avoid losing height.\n- Speed is key: Many platforms in Vex 4 will fall or vanish seconds after you touch them; don't overthink your moves, trust your reflexes and keep moving forward.\n- Look for 'Ghost' blocks: Some platforms are only visible for a few seconds—pay attention to the flickering edges to know when it's safe to land.",
