    "description": "The legend continues in Vex 5, elevating the platforming series with even more complex puzzles and hazardous gauntlets. Master the art of the perfect wall-jump and double-leap to navigate through nine intense acts filled with crushing blocks, electric fields, and high-speed zip-lines. With its generous checkpoint system and unlimited lives, Vex 5 encourages experimentation and persistence as you learn to conquer every obstacle through trial and error. Test your skills against the specialized challenge levels for a true parkour masterclass.\n\nHow to Play & Tips:\n- Control your air time: Use the double-jump only when necessary—sometimes a single jump with a long hold is better for landing on moving targets.\n- Use the zip-lines: When riding a zip-line, you can jump off at any point; use this to launch yourself over spikes that would be otherwise unreachable.\n- Watch for red blocks: Red indicates danger! Any surface glowing red will likely kill you or disappear instantly upon contact—treat them with extreme caution.",
