      "href": "/g/99-nights-in-the-forest",
      "description": "**99 Nights in the Forest** is a survival-horror game developed by Grandma’s Favourite Games, released on March 4, 2025, on the Roblox platform. Players are challenged to endure 99 consecutive nights in a perilous forest environment, where they must gather resources, build and defend their camp, and confront supernatural threats, including the formidable entity known as \"The Deer.\" \n\n## Key Features\n\n- **Resource Management and Crafting**: During daylight, players collect essential materials such as wood, food, and coal to construct and upgrade their base. Crafting advanced tools and weapons is crucial for nighttime defense.\n\n- **Dynamic Day-Night Cycle**: The game features a dynamic cycle where days are dedicated to exploration and preparation, while nights bring increased dangers, including attacks from hostile entities like bears, wolves, cultists, and the primary antagonist, The Deer. \n\n- **Class System**: The introduction of a comprehensive class system allows players to choose from seven distinct classes—Camper, Scavenger, Medic, Cook, Lumberjack, Ranger, and Assassin—each offering unique perks and starting items to cater to diverse playstyles. \n\n- **Multiplayer Cooperative Play**: Players can team up with others to enhance their chances of survival, strategize base defenses, and share resources.\n\n## Latest Notable Updates\n\nThe developers have been actively enhancing the game with regular updates:\n\n- **Hedge Maze Update (November 1, 2025)**: Introduced a new location, the Hedge Maze, as part of the Halloween festivities. This update also added the Vampire class, featuring abilities like lifesteal energy during melee attacks and improved night vision. \n\n- **Taming Update (October 4, 2025)**: Players can now tame various animals using Taming Flutes, adding a new layer of strategy to the game. The update also introduced the Zookeeper class, specializing in animal taming. \n\n- **Classes Update (June 27, 2025)**: This significant update introduced the class system, allowing players to select from seven specialized classes, each with unique abilities and starting items, enhancing gameplay diversity. \n\nFor players interested in similar survival and adventure experiences, [Minecraft](/class/Minecraft) offers expansive worlds and creative building opportunities. Additionally, [Undertale Yellow](/class/Undertale-Yellow) provides a unique narrative-driven adventure with engaging combat mechanics.\n\nWith its immersive gameplay, regular content updates, and a dedicated community, **99 Nights in the Forest** continues to captivate players seeking a challenging survival-horror experience.\n\nHow to Play:\n- - W, A, S, D to move\n- - Space to jump\n- - Left Mouse Click to interact\n- - E to interact\n- - F to toggle flashlight",
