      "image": "among-us.webp",
      "href": "/g/among-us",
      "description": "Among Us is a multiplayer social deduction game developed by Innersloth, where players collaborate to complete tasks on a spaceship while identifying hidden Impostors among the crew. The game supports 4 to 15 players and offers cross-platform play across various devices, including iOS, Android, Windows, Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, and Xbox Series X/S. \n\nIn Among Us, Crewmates work together to perform maintenance tasks, such as rewiring electrical systems and refueling engines, while Impostors aim to sabotage these efforts and eliminate Crewmates without being detected. The game features multiple maps, including The Skeld, MIRA HQ, Polus, The Airship, and the recently introduced Fungle, a mushroom jungle environment. \n\nThe latest update, Version 17.0.0, introduced two new roles: the Detective and the Viper. The Detective can interrogate other players to gather information about their whereabouts during a crime, aiding in identifying Impostors. The Viper, an Impostor role, has the ability to dissolve bodies over time, leaving no evidence behind. \n\nFor fans of social deduction and strategy games, titles like [Clash Royale](/class/Clash-Royale) and [Five Nights At Freddys Pizzeria Simulator](/class/Five-Nights-At-Freddys-Pizzeria-Simulator) offer engaging experiences that test players' tactical skills and decision-making abilities.\n\nAmong Us continues to evolve with regular updates, introducing new roles, maps, and features that enhance gameplay and keep the community engaged.\n\nHow to Play:\n- - W, A, S, D to move\n- - Space to interact\n- - E to report\n- - Q to kill\n- - Tab to open map",
