      "description": "Crazy Cattle 3D is an innovative physics-based battle royale game where players control explosive sheep in a quest to be the last one standing. Set across three distinct environments—Ireland's rolling hills, Iceland's volcanic terrain, and New Zealand's mountainous landscapes—each map offers unique challenges that require strategic use of momentum and terrain to outmaneuver opponents. \n\nThe game's custom physics engine delivers realistic sheep movement, making every collision and charge unpredictable and exhilarating. Players can activate an explosive charge ability to send rivals flying, adding a tactical layer to the fast-paced combat. With no micro-transactions or pay-to-win mechanics, success in Crazy Cattle 3D is purely skill-based, rewarding players who master the game's mechanics and strategies. \n\nFor those who enjoy physics-driven gameplay, titles like [Ragdoll Archers](/class/Ragdoll-Archers) and [Ragdoll Hit](/class/Ragdoll-Hit) offer similar experiences where mastering movement and timing are key to victory. Additionally, fans of unique battle royale formats might appreciate [1v1.lol](/class/1v1.lol), which combines building mechanics with competitive combat.\n\nSince its release in April 2025, Crazy Cattle 3D has introduced several updates, including the addition of the New Zealand map, a 30% faster physics solver, and an increased charge cooldown, enhancing gameplay balance and performance.  Available for free on Windows, macOS, Linux, and directly in browsers, Crazy Cattle 3D offers accessible and engaging gameplay for all players.\n\nHow to Play:\n- - W, A, S, D to move\n- - Space to charge\n- - Mouse to steer\n- - Q to quick turn\n- - Shift to sprint",
