      "description": "Eggy Car is a captivating physics-based driving game that challenges players to transport a fragile egg atop a vehicle across undulating terrains without letting it fall. The objective is to navigate through hills, valleys, and obstacles, maintaining a delicate balance between speed and control to prevent the egg from cracking. This game combines simple mechanics with intricate challenges, making it both accessible and engaging for players of all ages.\n\n## Key Features\n\n- **Physics-Driven Gameplay**: Every movement affects the egg's stability, requiring players to master acceleration and braking to keep the egg secure. \n\n- **Intuitive Controls**: Utilize straightforward controls—accelerate with the right arrow or 'D' key and brake with the left arrow or 'A' key—to maneuver the vehicle effectively. \n\n- **Diverse Terrains**: Encounter a variety of landscapes, including steep hills and sudden drops, each presenting unique challenges that test your driving skills. \n\n- **Collectibles and Upgrades**: Gather coins along your journey to unlock new vehicles, each offering distinct advantages in terms of speed and stability. \n\n- **Power-Ups**: Utilize special items like the freeze power-up, which temporarily stabilizes the egg, aiding in navigating particularly tricky sections. \n\n## Latest Updates\n\nAs of August 2025, Eggy Car has introduced new vehicles and terrains, enhancing the gaming experience with fresh challenges and customization options. These updates aim to keep the gameplay engaging and provide players with new goals to achieve. \n\n## Related Games\n\nIf you enjoy the unique challenges of Eggy Car, you might also like:\n\n- [Drive Mad](/class/Drive-Mad): Test your driving skills in this intense game that pushes your reflexes to the limit.\n\n- [Kart Bros](/class/Kart-Bros): Engage in thrilling kart races with dynamic tracks and competitive AI opponents.\n\n- [Poly Track](/class/Poly-Track): Navigate through intricate tracks that require precision and strategy to master.\n\n- [Obby But Youre On A Bike](/class/Obby-But-Youre-On-A-Bike): Experience obstacle courses with a twist, balancing on a bike through challenging levels.\n\nThese games offer similar physics-based challenges and engaging gameplay mechanics that fans of Eggy Car are sure to appreciate.\n\nHow to Play:\n- - Right Arrow or D to accelerate\n- - Left Arrow or A to brake\n- - Space to freeze egg\n- - Tap right side to accelerate (mobile)\n- - Tap left side to brake (mobile)",
