      "href": "/g/five-nights-at-freddys-2",
      "description": "**Five Nights at Freddy's 2** is the second installment in the acclaimed horror game series developed by Scott Cawthon. Set in Freddy Fazbear's Pizza, players assume the role of a night security guard tasked with surviving five nights while monitoring and managing the movements of animatronic characters through security cameras. The game introduces new animatronics, each with unique behaviors, enhancing the challenge and depth of gameplay.\n\nKey features include the absence of traditional doors, requiring players to use a Freddy Fazbear mask to evade detection by animatronics. Additionally, the game incorporates a music box mechanic that must be wound periodically to prevent certain animatronics from becoming active. These elements contribute to a heightened sense of tension and strategy.\n\nThe most recent update, version 2.0.5, released on October 16, 2023, removed the short delay when putting on the mask after flipping down the monitor and included minor fixes and improvements. \n\nFans of **Five Nights at Freddy's 2** might also enjoy exploring other horror-themed games such as [Granny](/class/Granny), [Backrooms](/class/Backrooms), and [Baldis Basics](/class/Baldis-Basics), each offering unique and thrilling experiences.\n\nHow to Play:\n- - Left Mouse Click to interact\n- - Right Mouse Click to use flashlight\n- - Spacebar to put on Freddy Fazbear mask\n- - Scroll Wheel to switch cameras\n- - Left Mouse Click to wind up music box",
