      "href": "/g/hollow-knight",
      "description": "Hollow Knight is a critically acclaimed 2D Metroidvania action-adventure game developed and published by Team Cherry. Released in 2017, it invites players to explore the vast, interconnected world of Hallownest—a fallen kingdom teeming with secrets, challenging enemies, and intricate lore. Players assume the role of a silent, insectoid warrior known as the Knight, embarking on a journey to uncover the mysteries lurking beneath the surface. \n\n## Key Features\n\n- **Expansive World**: Traverse a beautifully hand-drawn, interconnected world filled with diverse environments, from overgrown wilds to ruined cities.\n\n- **Challenging Combat**: Engage in precise, skill-based combat against over 130 unique enemies and 30 epic bosses, utilizing a variety of abilities and spells.\n\n- **Customization**: Equip Charms to modify abilities and tailor gameplay to individual playstyles.\n\n- **Rich Lore**: Uncover the deep history of Hallownest through environmental storytelling and interactions with a cast of quirky characters.\n\n- **Free Content Packs**: Enjoy additional content through free expansions like \"Hidden Dreams,\" \"The Grimm Troupe,\" \"Lifeblood,\" and \"Godmaster,\" each introducing new quests, bosses, and abilities. \n\n## Latest Notable Updates\n\nIn September 2025, the highly anticipated sequel, *Hollow Knight: Silksong*, was released, continuing the legacy of its predecessor. The launch saw an overwhelming response, with over 110,000 concurrent players on Steam within the first 30 minutes, despite technical issues due to high demand.  *Silksong* introduces new mechanics, characters, and a fresh narrative, further expanding the Hollow Knight universe.\n\nFor fans of challenging, atmospheric platformers, *Hollow Knight* offers an experience akin to titles like [The Binding of Isaac](/class/The-Binding-of-Isaac) and [Undertale Yellow](/class/Undertale-Yellow), blending intricate world-building with demanding gameplay.\n\nWhether you're a seasoned adventurer or new to the genre, *Hollow Knight* provides a rich, immersive journey through a hauntingly beautiful world, solidifying its place as a modern classic in the Metroidvania genre.\n\nHow to Play:\n- - W, A, S, D to move\n- - Space to jump\n- - Left Mouse Click to attack\n- - Right Mouse Click to quick cast\n- - Shift to dash",
