      "href": "/g/papas-burgeria",
      "description": "Papa's Burgeria is a captivating time-management game developed by Flipline Studios, where players step into the role of managing a bustling burger restaurant. As either Marty or Rita, you'll take orders, grill patties to perfection, and assemble burgers with a variety of toppings to satisfy a diverse clientele. The game challenges players to multitask efficiently across different stations—Order, Grill, and Build—to ensure timely and accurate service, enhancing both customer satisfaction and in-game earnings. \n\nA standout feature of Papa's Burgeria is its extensive customization and upgrade options. Players can invest their hard-earned tips in purchasing new furniture, posters, and equipment to enhance the restaurant's ambiance and operational efficiency. Additionally, the game introduces unique customers, each with specific preferences, adding depth and replayability as you strive to master their favorite orders. \n\nFor those who enjoy the strategic aspects of managing a virtual business, games like [Monkey Mart](/class/Monkey-Mart) and [Idle Ants](/class/Idle-Ants) offer similar experiences. In [Monkey Mart](/class/Monkey-Mart), players oversee a supermarket, balancing inventory and customer satisfaction, while [Idle Ants](/class/Idle-Ants) involves managing an ant colony to gather resources and expand. These titles, along with Papa's Burgeria, provide engaging simulations that test your multitasking and strategic planning skills.\n\nAs of June 2025, Papa's Burgeria has been updated to version 1.2.4, featuring bug fixes and performance improvements to enhance the gaming experience.  Whether you're a seasoned fan or new to the series, this update ensures smoother gameplay as you build the ultimate burger empire.\n\nHow to Play:\n- - Left Mouse Click to interact\n- - Right Mouse Click to cancel action\n- - Scroll Wheel to zoom in/out\n- - Space to switch stations\n- - Esc to pause game",
