      "image": "street-fighter.webp",
      "href": "/g/street-fighter",
      "description": "Street Fighter is a legendary fighting game franchise developed by Capcom, first introduced in 1987. The series has evolved significantly over the decades, culminating in the release of *Street Fighter 6* in June 2023. This latest installment introduces innovative gameplay features, including a real-time commentary system and a single-player adventure mode with customizable avatars. Built on Capcom's RE Engine, *Street Fighter 6* offers enhanced visuals and supports cross-platform play, ensuring a seamless experience for players across different systems. \n\nIn August 2025, Capcom released the Year 3 update for *Street Fighter 6*, introducing the iconic Muay Thai master, Sagat, as a playable character. This update also added the new \"Proud Spire\" stage and a variety of new outfits for characters like Luke, Jamie, and Kimberly. Additionally, the update expanded the World Tour mode with new missions and mini-games, offering players fresh content and challenges. \n\nFor fans of intense fighting games, *Street Fighter 6* offers a rich and dynamic experience. Players interested in exploring other engaging titles might enjoy [Gladihoppers](/class/Gladihoppers), a game that combines fast-paced combat with strategic elements. Additionally, [Ultrakill](/class/Ultrakill) provides a high-octane shooting experience with retro-inspired graphics, appealing to those who appreciate adrenaline-fueled gameplay.\n\nAs of June 2025, *Street Fighter 6* has sold over 5 million units worldwide, reflecting its enduring popularity and the franchise's ability to adapt and innovate within the fighting game genre. \n\nFor a visual overview of the latest updates, including Sagat's introduction and new features, you can watch the official Year 3 Update Overview Trailer below:\n\nHow to Play:\n- - W, A, S, D to move\n- - Space to jump\n- - Left Mouse Click to light attack\n- - Right Mouse Click to medium attack\n- - Middle Mouse Click to heavy attack",
