      "description": "Super Mario Bros. is a seminal platform game developed and published by Nintendo, first released in 1985. Players control Mario, navigating through the Mushroom Kingdom to rescue Princess Peach from the villainous Bowser. The game is renowned for its precise controls, innovative level design, and iconic power-ups like the Super Mushroom and Fire Flower. Its success laid the foundation for the platformer genre and established Mario as a cultural icon.\n\nIn recent years, Nintendo has revitalized the Super Mario series with new titles and updates. For instance, *Super Mario Bros. Wonder*, released in October 2023, introduced the Wonder Flower, which triggers dynamic changes in gameplay, such as transforming environments and altering character abilities. This title also supports both local and online multiplayer modes, allowing up to four players to collaborate or compete in various challenges. \n\nFor fans of classic platformers, [Super Mario 64](/class/Super-Mario-64) offers a nostalgic 3D adventure, while [Hollow Knight](/class/Hollow-Knight) provides a challenging and atmospheric experience in a beautifully crafted world. Additionally, [Undertale Yellow](/class/Undertale-Yellow) delivers a unique blend of storytelling and gameplay, appealing to those who appreciate narrative-driven games.\n\nAs of November 2025, Nintendo continues to celebrate the legacy of Super Mario Bros. with various events and releases, ensuring that both longtime fans and new players can enjoy the adventures of Mario and his friends.\n\nHow to Play:\n- - Left Arrow to move left\n- - Right Arrow to move right\n- - Up Arrow to jump\n- - Down Arrow to crouch\n- - B to run",
